{
 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.27,
   "end": 6.61,
   "text": "Quick question, if you stopped working today, how long before your family's lifestyle changes?"
  },
  {
   "start": 8.15,
   "end": 17.45,
   "text": "For most people, the honest answer is fast, because most people are 100% dependent on their W-2 and when that paycheck stops,"
  },
  {
   "start": 17.95,
   "end": 25.73,
   "text": "everything stops. Sure, you could sell off stocks and liquidate 401ks, but that's a countdown clock, not a real plan."
  },
  {
   "start": 25.73,
   "end": 30.91,
   "text": "You're still burning down assets to stay afloat, and eventually one of two things will happen."
  },
  {
   "start": 31.35,
   "end": 34.45,
   "text": "Either it all comes crashing down, or you have to go back to work."
  },
  {
   "start": 35.17,
   "end": 38.15,
   "text": "Here's what we do that's a bit different at a Cabo home."
  },
  {
   "start": 38.55,
   "end": 43.83,
   "text": "We help people move that number from say 100% dependent on the W-2 to 75%,"
  },
  {
   "start": 44.57,
   "end": 50.15,
   "text": "then to 50%, then to 25%, and then to 0% dependent on the W-2."
  },
  {
   "start": 50.15,
   "end": 60.87,
   "text": "Every rental unit, every house hack, every cash flowing asset turns that dial down until your assets cover your monthly expenses and the paycheck becomes optional."
  },
  {
   "start": 61.31,
   "end": 68.27,
   "text": "It becomes fun money. No selling, no countdown clock. And I'm not selling you theory, I've actually lived this."
  },
  {
   "start": 68.61,
   "end": 76.39,
   "text": "I was in medical device sales making $250K a year on average. Good money, but 100% dependent on me showing up."
  },
  {
   "start": 76.39,
   "end": 81.13,
   "text": "Today, I'm in full-time real estate, and my assets are covering my living expenses."
  },
  {
   "start": 81.61,
   "end": 86.47,
   "text": "My family's lifestyle doesn't depend on my next paycheck, it depends on the assets that I own."
  },
  {
   "start": 87.01,
   "end": 93.59,
   "text": "That's the picture we help people build. So my question back to you is what percent dependent are you right now?"
  },
  {
   "start": 94.11,
   "end": 98.75,
   "text": "Drop it in the comments if you feel comfortable, and if you want a roadmap to move that number,"
  },
  {
   "start": 99.07,
   "end": 101.49,
   "text": "there's a link in the bio to schedule time to chat."
  }
 ],
